# hongguo sidecar

This crate is a thin CLI around the reference implementation
[it00021hot/hongguo-desktop](https://github.com/it00021hot/hongguo-desktop)
(crates `hongguo-signer`, `hongguo-api`), which is licensed under the
**PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0** (noncommercial use only; keep this
notice when redistributing).

The Go core keeps download / CENC decryption / range proxy / player handoff and
only asks this sidecar for the official `video_model`; the existing
`miniReelCompatibleModel` then applies the official `fallback_api`
(`codec_type=1` → HEVC) when the model is bytevc2-only.

Build (requires rustc >= 1.99, the cloned reference workspace and the NDK):

    cargo build --release --target aarch64-linux-android
    cargo build --release --target armv7-linux-androideabi

then copy the binaries to `android/app/src/main/jniLibs/<abi>/libhgsidecar.so`.
